{"availability":"available","full":"koedame/chordsketch","name":"chordsketch","description":"A Rust implementation of the ChordPro music notation format — parser, renderers, and CLI","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":12,"forks":3,"created":"2026-03-29T15:17:20Z","updated":"2026-10-18T06:22:31Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://github.com/koedame/chordsketch","topics":["chord","chordpro","cli","lyrics","music","parser","pdf","rust"],"demo":"https://koedame.github.io/chordsketch/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T16:53:53.172Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T16:53:53.172Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T16:53:53.172Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:17:36.039Z","stars":11,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-05T18:19:21.084Z","stars":11,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:48.929Z","stars":11,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-09T08:56:54.851Z","stars":11,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-12T09:44:04.566Z","stars":11,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-18T16:53:53.172Z","stars":12,"forks":3}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A Rust implementation of the ChordPro and iReal Pro chord chart formats. It reads ChordPro files (parse to a structured AST, render to plain text, HTML, and PDF), parses irealb:// URLs, renders iReal Pro charts to SVG / PNG / PDF, and converts between ChordPro and iReal Pro.","ChordSketch is not a drop-in replacement for the Perl ChordPro implementation. It parses every directive that ChordPro R6.101.0 does except six obsolete ones, but its output is not identical to Perl's and it offers fewer output formats. See Known Deviations for the list."],"features":["ChordPro format parser with","zero external dependencies in the core crate. Parses the directives of ChordPro R6.101.0 except six obsolete ones (details)","Three output formats: plain text, HTML, and PDF","Configuration file system (chordsketch.json)","Inline markup (bold, italic, etc.)"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/koe